            "correctIndex": 1
          },
          "literalSHA256": "33c4f7d4541cf0f2c80d38abe03b421ab986c5e6ac0c203b1b8eb5230ec3c277",
          "primaryGround": "The retained fedora definition exactly matches a low soft felt hat with its crown creased lengthwise. The other options are sourced neighboring hat types: stiff dome-crowned derby/bowler, close-fitting rounded cloche, and low flat-topped porkpie.",
