        {
          "group": "explanation",
          "literal": "Федора — низкая мягкая фетровая шляпа с продольной складкой на тулье. У котелка тулья куполообразная, у клоша глубокая округлая, а у «порк-пая» плоский верх.",
          "literalSHA256": "5d97e307a1d32938a2401bda1239eb355b3ce041fddc0c981bdd2e1accaddba4",
          "primaryGround": "The first sentence states the fedora definition. Each contrast names a sourced structural feature of one distractor: dome-shaped crown, deep rounded crown, or flat porkpie top.",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a17b9e/source-fashion26/raw/mw-fedora.json",
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a17bfa/source-fashion28-cycle1/mw-derby.json",
