          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note2",
          "literal": "Клош — женская облегающая шляпа, обычно с глубокой округлой тульей и узкими полями.",
          "literalSHA256": "644a6317faafb23843af26d7b901f345a29b58b120964b3a0d698627f728e4d9",
          "primaryGround": "The cloche entry defines the hat as close-fitting, usually with a deep rounded crown and narrow brim.",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a17bfa/source-fashion28-cycle1/mw-cloche.json"
          ],
          "locator": [
